# Line endings (docs/windows/AUDIT.md B15). Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true.
# Scripts the Pi runs must keep LF even when someone edits/commits them on Windows.
*.sh       text eol=lf
*.service  text eol=lf
*.timer    text eol=lf
*.path     text eol=lf
*.mjs      text eol=lf
# Committed data defaults are edited in place by the admin panel: never convert them, or every one of them
# shows as "changed" on a Windows checkout and can block `git pull --ff-only`.
data/**    -text
